[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Ring Buffers
REQ_PREFIX: ZEP-SRS-40-

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: software_requirements.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-1
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Ring buffer definition
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to define a ring buffer at compile time
and to initialize a ring buffer at run time with caller-provided storage.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-2
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Storing bytes
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to store a sequence of bytes in a ring
buffer, returning the number of bytes stored when the free space is insufficient
for the whole sequence.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-3
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Retrieving bytes
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to retrieve and remove a sequence of
bytes from a ring buffer, returning the number of bytes retrieved.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-4
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Reading without removal
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to read bytes from a ring buffer
without removing them.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-5
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Direct write access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to claim a contiguous region of a ring
buffer for writing directly into its storage and to commit the amount written.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-6
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Direct read access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to claim a contiguous region of a ring
buffer for reading directly from its storage and to release the amount consumed.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-7
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Storing data items
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to store and retrieve variable-sized
data items, each carrying an application-defined type identifier, in a ring
buffer.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-8
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Capacity queries
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide mechanisms to query the free space of a ring buffer
and whether it is empty.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-9
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Ring buffer reset
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to discard the contents of a ring
buffer, returning it to its empty state.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-40-10
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: Ring Buffer
TITLE: Concurrent producer and consumer
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall support one context storing data into a ring buffer while
one other context concurrently retrieves data from it, without additional
synchronization.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-22
